RAW SUMMARY (no tuning anywhere):
  - commutator pullback = (i/2pi) d'(s), kappa-INDEPENDENT (Part B lemma)
    => exact dissipation/gamma trajectory-blind; exact steady state kappa-only
  - exact resummed G(kappa; Omega, gamma): finite for all kappa, all gamma;
    matches agentB at weak coupling; +log growth at high kappa (slope 1/4pi^2)
  - m_resp = G + (a^2/kappa)G': NONZERO kappa-only floor at a->0 at every
    coupling; F4's mu = a/kappa excluded by the Part-C ODE for the EXACT G
  - best affine mimic of mu_F4 over the whole class: max|dev| printed above
  - inertia-deficit corner hunt (gapless + strong coupling): see [D7] raw
    numbers; in every case the response is kappa-only: NOT the F4 structure
